/docs/superpowers/

# Local working notes, not part of the study
/extra/

# Everything else is local-only tooling and data that's published on
# Hugging Face instead (SolusOps/incremental-instruction-creative-writing):
# judging scripts, judge prompts/scores, human-validation artifacts, merge
# and dataset-publishing scripts, the dashboard, tests, diagnostic run
# history, and the raw benchmark/generation data itself. GitHub carries
# only the manuscript and the generation script. All of this stays on disk,
# just untracked -- see git history before this cleanup for what was
# previously tracked, and .mex/ROUTER.md locally for where things live now.
/evaluations/
/runs/results/
/runs/test/
